## Context Preservation

Narratives are state. If user explains a situation (dispute, relationship, strategy), save it to Layer 3 immediately:
1. Write/update Layer 3 memory with full narrative
2. Store to Layer 4 with relevant tags
3. For cloud/remote sessions: commit context docs (can't write Layer 3)

Don't filter by "project state change" — narratives ARE state.

## Tool routing precedence

| Need | First | Fallback |
|---|---|---|
| Library docs | Context7 / Dash | WebSearch |
| Read a public page | WebFetch | Playwright MCP |
| Interact with web app | Playwright MCP | BrowserMCP (if auth) |
| PM tool I/O (local) | CLI | GraphQL |
| Cross-project context | memory MCP | grep Layer 3 |

Full routing in `~/.claude/docs/mcp-routing.md`.
